B.VB=new A.a4("When school holidays coincide with weekend crowds, the train's occupancy rate reaches its peak. This is the configuration of major tourist migration movements: families, groups of friends, and vacationers cross paths in numbers through the corridors, infusing a dynamic of permanent animation and collective effervescence characteristic of great moments of escape.",null,B.aC,null,null,null,null)
B.VC=new A.a4("Au c\u0153ur de la journ\xe9e en semaine, apr\xe8s l'effervescence des d\xe9parts matinaux, l'atmosph\xe8re \xe0 bord subit une m\xe9tamorphose radicale. Le rythme du train s'harmonise avec le panorama rural qui d\xe9file de part et d'autre des fen\xeatres. Un calme feutr\xe9 s'installe durablement dans les wagons, offrant aux rares passagers un sanctuaire de s\xe9r\xe9nit\xe9 id\xe9al pour la concentration, la relecture de dossiers complexes ou une parenth\xe8se de repos studieux.",null,B.aC,null,null,null,null)
B.VD=new A.a4("Ghent Favorites",null,B.cE,null,null,null,null)
B.VE=new A.a4("During school holiday periods, Eurostar transforms into an eminently lively and family-oriented space. Storage areas fill with bulky suitcases and strollers, while carriages come alive to the rhythm of children's laughter and enthusiastic conversations. The general atmosphere breathes the excitement of major getaways, contrasting sharply with the rigor of usual business flows.",null,B.aC,null,null,null,null)
